7	/**
8	 * Assigns the owner's {@code householdSize}: the number of members in the owner's household
9	 * (owners sharing the same {@code householdId}) after this create — the already-stored members
10	 * plus this new owner. Runs after {@link AssignHousehold} (so the new owner's computed
11	 * {@code householdId} is set) and before {@code save} (so the new owner is not yet counted among
12	 * the stored members, and is instead added as the {@code + 1}). Existing members are found by their
13	 * own stored {@code householdId}, which — being deterministic from lastName + postcode — already
